abstract: "A reproducible, research-grade decision intelligence platform for AI-driven fleet repositioning. Combines spatiotemporal demand forecasting, multi-agent simulation, offline reinforcement learning with trajectory-aware doubly robust policy evaluation, and production-style API/Docker deployment on NYC TLC trip data."
keywords:
  - urban mobility
  - taxi recommendation
  - reinforcement learning
  - offline policy evaluation
